From e4ca7369024ec862baa46c20b0bc1bdf520321c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openhands <openhands@all-hands.dev>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 20:49:41 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add a Changelog page

Adds /changelog, listing every agent update in the registry as one
combined feed (newest first, tie-broken by agent name), with a
"Changelog" link in the portal nav.

Co-authored-by: openhands <openhands@all-hands.dev>
---
